  "level": 2,
  "questionLabels": [],
  "question": {
    "text": "A regular polygon of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> sides is formed by bending a wire of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></math> meter. If an electric current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is flowing through the sides of the polygon, the magnetic field at the centre of the polygon would be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "72",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/172ddb07-d81f-4ecb-b61f-e325e9d6890a.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 178px;\"/></p><p>Direction of magnetic field due to all six sides will be in the same direction, therefore we can write </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo></math>distance of the sides from the centre.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mstyle></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
